# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PromptGen — Root & Frontend Environment Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Optional: Override backend API base URL (defaults to http://localhost:8080/api/v1 or /api/v1 via Vite proxy)
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1

# Note on API Keys:
# PromptGen uses a client-side BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) architecture.
# Keys are entered in the UI, stored strictly in-memory during the session,
# and sent directly to AI providers (Gemini, OpenAI, Groq, OpenRouter, DeepSeek, Mistral, Ollama).
# Keys are NEVER written to unencrypted storage.
